<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/ruh/dict/koch/1> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "रुह् I /ruh/ (P. pr. /rahati/ — I- fut. /ro-kṣyati/- pf. /ruroha/- aor. /arukṣat/- pp. /rūḍha/) 1) расти 2) подниматься"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
